{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "bf2b90a5878fb310e37e5aba1bb193254b42916ecafc437bb9c989e060f03de8", "ja": "彼女たちの選択", "zh": "少女们的选择", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6e9d2f19ad725cc7f9d67e663b888ad56de1fc06184bce2b9f850e5e575d5978", "ja": "レッスン中に振付のアレンジを思いつく翼。\nそのアレンジはより完成度が高いものの、\n難易度も高いものだった。もともとダンスに\n苦戦していた百合子は戸惑うが、よりよい\n公演にするため、挑戦することを決める。", "zh": "翼在练习中想到了新的舞步，虽然调整之后\n完成度会更高，但难度也随之提升。原本就\n因为舞蹈而陷入苦战的百合子虽然感到迷惘，\n但为了让公演更加精彩，她决定面对挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "22999800e6704ada31db55a045f9567546bf2a9b420c573fec08e211432d229f", "ja": "（今日は少し気分を変えようと、\n公園でレッスンをすることになった）", "zh": "（为了稍微转换心情，\n今天在公园进行训练课程。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e1ef1137ae14bed0d537f08fa303f4f35062d8cd87152b02f9164d5c9797130a", "ja": "公園で、公演のためのレッスンか……。", "zh": "在公园练习公演啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3e7d00eba9cee86080cad24ebef781c7af39f8f8f345123e19c33b1f753e524b", "ja": "うわっ！？　あ、ああ、瑞希か……。\nもう、みんな集まったのか？", "zh": "呜哇！？啊，瑞希，是你啊……\n大家都来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "893a1e876947470e294f6445040baf5af94e8d7beff030ba5b0bb01ff37f4c7c", "ja": "はい。……本番まで、あまり時間がありません。\nなので、今日は最後までしっかり確認しましょう。", "zh": "是的……正式表演前的时间所剩不多。\n所以今天就确实练到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "bc9786acf8341b7c5aeab568462ee3ee95a4f7d2b300fd2c2e23cc47793dc5e6", "ja": "公園で、公演のためのレッスン。\n……ナイスジョーク。", "zh": "在公园练习公演。\n……很好的笑话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "110c3b0c8be17052282fb4bedfc31e5aa5142349ef35d96beefb8025b99705bc", "ja": "聞かなかったことにしてくれないか……。", "zh": "你就当作没听见好不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "496b38dc39718813b31c303fea00021b8e0722cf31001e4971e0d4975ea24bd7", "ja": "ダンス、結構……そろって来たね……。\nこれなら、本番……何とか、なりそう……。", "zh": "大家的舞步……越来越整齐了呢……\n这样的话，正式演出……应该会有办法了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "6d02823a99068aa8431270d35c038e9dd971fc65b1dc35d23341f5082d4bb863", "ja": "うんうんっ、そうだよね！\nえへへ、本番楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，没错吧！\n嘿嘿，真期待正式演出呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "4f02071a648ba051d2e76655b96b6a019491117f3724bb23cb766bacb7c617d3", "ja": "……あれっ？　翼、どうしたの？", "zh": "……奇怪？怎么了吗，翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a60407acbde6c33394d5e444f39882af8ead8dba49eed014568444b0d3a6c470", "ja": "うん。今の振り付けもカワイイけど、もっと、\nわたし達らしい感じにできないかな～って！", "zh": "嗯，虽然现在的舞步已经很可爱了，\n但我在想能不能弄得更有我们的风格呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a27389c241d53131b807b6f2059f240b8336e6c8f936a1d64e16a66fd861d3ab", "ja": "例えば、さっきのダンスをさ……\nこういう風に、アレンジしてみるのはどう？", "zh": "例如把刚刚的舞步……\n改成这样的话怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3423975a49e8674b5fd380d46a9324164f80dbd7e2d830c27d14c59a09b9d246", "ja": "ね？　こんな感じ！", "zh": "看？就像这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "f23f6f6bca4edd7f267cd838cc4aa3cc4447c6a21afa9ff87d1d0a652bc1314f", "ja": "翼、スゴーい♪　すっごくカワイイし、\nなんか乙女ストーム！って感じがする！！", "zh": "翼，你好厉害～♪这样很可爱，\n而且总觉得很有『少女风暴！』的感觉！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f4d6d4d5751864d730194bfd949b461747a0c7653d5e6b2c3b0f29a3651f9077", "ja": "でしょでしょ～？　えへへ♪", "zh": "没错吧没错吧～？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "67e8f54a21ac35c84a0d5b102248dda7b586bce48d65291641571cc8ae9acbd7", "ja": "乙女ストーム！って感じがどんな感じかは\nよくわからないが、確かに可愛い振り付けだな。", "zh": "虽然我不知道『少女风暴！』的感觉是什么，\n但这舞步确实很可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1a7d1e30476eceb49b0aa87fca5222e284caedbf6f65df20298ead1231e54fab", "ja": "どうだ、みんな？\nせっかくだから、新しい振り付けを試してみるか？", "zh": "大家觉得怎么样？\n机会难得，要不要试试看新的舞步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "6a18884ea1abaabed3a4225d5c10ff32b6ed077ba9ed199dbf466b290834e2d0", "ja": "はいっ！　私、そうしたいです！\nファンのみんなも、喜んでくれると思うし……♪", "zh": "好的！我想试试看！\n我想粉丝们看了应该也会很高兴……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "35826ef8af7cff373d1acda9123c582aea1237896d9c7ac7a0eb25d64f3aa860", "ja": "やったぁ♪\nそれじゃさっそく、練習を……。", "zh": "太好了♪\n那我们赶快开始练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "595c7eff4bfab26630207f0e561b0c2ba7a958a3e9555b1212f1a4f70702e13c", "ja": "み、未来、翼！　ちょっと待って！", "zh": "未、未来还有翼！等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "98cab1c46fa96ac7730f41bbabd248d18f6574bb1ce409736fac7b7732e9e1f1", "ja": "百合子？", "zh": "百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a5d0755906bc203075c826fc05c9778ae1043d02b2aaf98720f291787dc572e4", "ja": "百合子ちゃん、どうかしたの～？", "zh": "百合子，怎么了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "2045043c5e25247b82f9fcfc9a370a041ffa46eb2534c9203aed80de718963ae", "ja": "確かに、翼のアレンジした振り付けの方が\nカワイイし、乙女ストーム！らしいけど……。", "zh": "翼修改的舞步确实更可爱，\n也很有『少女风暴！』的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "660708df2a5a64c873a2db9587c99f885e3db015d094f5106ded0f429032c60c", "ja": "最初の振り付けより、複雑だし……結構、\n難しくなっちゃってる気が……するんだけど……。", "zh": "但比一开始的舞步更复杂……\n感觉……变得很难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "5b9b0dc9e4d1acc46291ebb0f480a5a6a09fe99f14597b6adab189792c47e8cd", "ja": "はい。私も、七尾さんと同意見です。\n最初のダンスより、難易度は少々上がっているかと。", "zh": "是的，我的意见和七尾相同。\n认为难度比一开始的舞步高了一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "d78ff582412f49eba4989c7b8300248d6d2bd1c9a0f089bc4d5092e12dc9d122", "ja": "杏奈も……。それに、やっと覚えたのに……\n今から変わるの……不安……。", "zh": "杏奈也是……而且好不容易才记起来的……\n现在才要改……好不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "5efef0ffe1ee146b508644400b59347984c4dc347f51f35ceb5f4beaf63b4b62", "ja": "う～ん、そっか～……。", "zh": "唔～这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "03fcdf76bbde3923a50ea5321017f2cef6df7c80e443215d31d3fd6261008807", "ja": "とりあえず、アレンジした方の振り付け、\n一回やってみない？", "zh": "总之要不要先试一次\n调整过后的舞步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b37013353904fad0665415dbb348d081ad55d5da10a38663de3197dc7fb6d41", "ja": "元の振り付けにするか、アレンジした方にするかは、\nその後で決めようよ♪　ねっ！", "zh": "之后再决定要用原本的舞步，\n还是调整过的舞步吧♪好不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "2c05fd75d597431ae047c18375935fdd375f8145a09d18e28b8b8bc74a544cae", "ja": "うぅ……{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "264640e8cb5e6ff7d1cb61e3df90e905e88d9040ca47f35ab7e4f6737ce73760", "ja": "そうだな……本当に無理かどうか、試しに\nやるだけやってみよう。みんな、どうだ？", "zh": "这个嘛……先试着做做看，\n再看是不是真的不行吧。各位觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "6f098827b05bd7157ca7a8907339bfef2151a0d9272e8410dce9cec3f6afc999", "ja": "……わかりました。\nそれでは、試しにやってみましょう。", "zh": "……我知道了。\n那就先试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "4a48fcbdba1663d512a364f9050277e88486b91b1acbd3dbcf9a0c484350a82b", "ja": "杏奈も、わかった……。\n百合子さん……。", "zh": "杏奈也了解了……\n百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "15367a1420e1f73e839a4d8e81c1948deb22252569d8a2b68db5d6e4b5239fd2", "ja": "う、うん……。それじゃ、試すだけ……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……那就先试一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "0b46275792c309491d0a5aa00cf0e4ab66906d7f985d9488f5c105b23f63f547", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。ううっ、やっぱりダメだよ……\nみんなに、全然ついていけない……。", "zh": "呼、呼……呜呜，果然办不到……\n完全跟不上大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "3e98312bd1e3daf93d9f261b6e21c1f8b44ffed0dbd7b4f277958f27963d18e0", "ja": "私には、この振り付け難しすぎるのかも……。", "zh": "这个舞蹈动作对我来说可能太难了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "71167f0c5c16b0ba851f09a1e8c835f3e703fa75e028da347e9fd8102ee9980b", "ja": "うーん……{$P$}さんは、\nどうしたらいいと思います？", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}先生\n觉得要怎么做比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "65a6cf4124c405740317db6c7504e3d71d516f336f1f664c17a6c9416ef03743", "ja": "そうだな……。公演まで時間もないし、\n元の振り付けのままというのも、ひとつの選択だ。", "zh": "这个嘛……毕竟公演前也没剩多少时间了，\n用原本的舞步也是一个选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f63518c1e59dec4f9010c813503a12525980d728b6fb3a588fda9a7ae3149880", "ja": "乙女ストーム！は5人のユニットだしな。\n……未来はどう思っているんだ？", "zh": "毕竟『少女风暴！』是五个人的团体嘛。\n……未来认为呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "ce1273bd1469bfeb994a3d9687156666abe1f643ccb426398e0ae08649420808", "ja": "うーん……。翼の振り付け、カワイイし。\n私も、やってみたいですけど……。", "zh": "唔嗯……翼的舞步很可爱，\n我也很想试试看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "49eccf5a07b11d2a1a18f85ec55b2fc67f2f12282d3c29997fb677306df95d5a", "ja": "でもでも{$P$}さんも言ってたけど、\n乙女ストーム！は5人で乙女ストーム！なんですよー。", "zh": "但是但是，{$P$}先生也说了，\n要有我们五个人一起才是『少女风暴！』呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "02ad9283069469eb01506197af525344476e06822cadfce2c3e913a8f62bb08a", "ja": "だから私達みんなで踊れなくちゃ、意味がないし……。\nでもカワイイ方が絶対盛り上がるし……うう……。", "zh": "所以我们要五个人一起跳才有意义……\n但可爱的舞步一定会比较嗨……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "2d4043119344810374d8cbf02d9fb83b2178ce26babf798fa6f54293870be100", "ja": "……あれっ？　頭がグルグルしてきちゃった！？\nど、どうしよ～、決められないよ～！", "zh": "……奇怪？脑袋一团混乱了！？\n怎、怎么办～我没办法决定啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1044_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c2dcad0aa7d912b26b0b30ecf9d1591fc1648644d6bce24a5a284d2df1be774b", "ja": "も～。未来がパニックになってどうするの～？", "zh": "真是的～未来你慌什么慌啊～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8253c7042189894fcd499a34fdc9289f0d977d882fe05b4d0dcd4f466cbcc5a0", "ja": "やっぱり、アレンジは止めとこっか？\n元の振り付けだってカワイイしね。", "zh": "还是不要改舞步了吧？\n毕竟本来的动作也已经很可爱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "f07411b9683ec64d4b2f3bc30989141160a8f5af8a1f7c7613753ce8da1a82df", "ja": "うん……そうしよっか……。", "zh": "嗯……就这样吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "61c73db503dbdd22c1092389eb0603510118e8ed4267a5dca0ec73998cb14639", "ja": "……あ……。", "zh": "……啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "98cab1c46fa96ac7730f41bbabd248d18f6574bb1ce409736fac7b7732e9e1f1", "ja": "百合子？", "zh": "百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "30856fbc2f0d8696ea7d6169ac675c77f94b78db562a9c9ed7fc6601e1d2dd6d", "ja": "え、えっと、あの……。\n私……その……。", "zh": "呃、呃，那个……\n我……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_1050", "source_sha256": "d09786f9f330868a97f2bb153c0482781bc2c9e4eaec990dc1dfaafe260a4f1a", "ja": "背中を押す", "zh": "出手帮忙", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d91132b6eceb2d055e9e1d002c8e002c2ad930c2b739106daedecc03a928b458", "ja": "百合子。何か言いたいことがあるなら、\n遠慮なく言っていいんだぞ。", "zh": "百合子，如果你有什么话想说，\n可以直说无妨喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2001_044miz", "source_sha256": "6069735722f7d3256bb4380d0389ba0d45f05e985496288ffd4caea51e45c162", "ja": "七尾さん。……ぐっ。", "zh": "七尾……加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2002_024ann", "source_sha256": "2b037bb034aba9934f7ddf33b7d1fcb97db0633fd24472830596280e1be74b63", "ja": "百合子、さん……。頑張れ……。", "zh": "百合子……加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2003_026yur", "source_sha256": "9e650c712d6abd11f63c150ac07d3269415812c2e9611871296688a5378900c8", "ja": "瑞希さん、杏奈ちゃん……う、うん！", "zh": "瑞希、小杏……嗯、嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2004_026yur", "source_sha256": "452718112f6b358911566eb755788cc4b637df47106ec693ed921b0b52fbb854", "ja": "あの、未来……翼。翼が考えた振り付けの方が、\nカワイイし……お客さんも、盛り上がる……んだよね？", "zh": "那个，未来……翼。翼你想的舞蹈动作\n比较可爱……也比较能带动气氛……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2005_014mir", "source_sha256": "8e3d69a264d8beca1832a9dd1a0c5684d3af7e8a6682e48d0afa5809ebf39d71", "ja": "……うん！　絶対そうだと思う！", "zh": "……嗯！我觉得一定可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2006_026yur", "source_sha256": "97090ee79b815e38fea1b2c6333874940f24ffba8f1d03289d55ca3038ea406a", "ja": "あの……できるかどうかは、わからないけど……。\n私……ち、挑戦してみてもいいかな？", "zh": "那个……虽然不知道能不能成功……\n我……可、可以挑战看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2007_026yur", "source_sha256": "0253c26d5d887e6d0b434e2028468374f91515a46ae7ef4a661dc56368598c95", "ja": "あっ、でも、やっぱりダメだって言うかもしれないし！\nみんなの足を、引っ張っちゃうかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "啊，但是搞不好之后又会说还是不行！\n可能会扯大家的后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2008_014mir", "source_sha256": "b6d0c87e8fb78d9747e6e594ec625a8dabba2bba18666f8f065c8e2cd9c17d76", "ja": "そんなの、全然いいよー！\n百合子、ありがとー！！", "zh": "那完全没关系啦～！\n百合子，谢谢你～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c9bae11d24975f89bc727f4e6f1b74b9a98d3c02986c14966976ce8edc1b399d", "ja": "百合子ちゃん、でもホントにいいの？\n本番まで、あんまり時間ないけど……。", "zh": "百合子，可是真的可以吗？\n到正式演出也没剩多少时间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2010_026yur", "source_sha256": "a6f0047bc99c1000ee51341e63e7adb21ce47d840a5729bdd2c6af27e9fdeb25", "ja": "そ、それは……。正直、自信があるとは、全然\n言えないんだけど……。やれるだけ、やってみる……。", "zh": "那、那个……说真的，我完全说不出\n有信心……但我想尽力尝试看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2011_026yur", "source_sha256": "f15ea7079ead5c35d5964287c1626500a0d4f257502a84823ce975153dc7f48c", "ja": "み、みんな……よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "大、大家……请多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "386fdbcadf87972db1cfe5b28adc675cc2a3d0e5ec47885c705a379dfadf8e7f", "ja": "オッケー！　それじゃ、後はわたしに任せて♪\nちゃんと教えてあげるから！", "zh": "OK！那接下来就交给我吧♪\n我会好好教大家跳的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2013_p", "source_sha256": "9cba0cf33c103e5160ca49acc624eddae0b4a61e51e761055671b488f1f72f5b", "ja": "（乙女ストーム！の5人は、挑戦する道を選んだ。\nうまくいくかは本人達次第……）", "zh": "（『少女风暴！』的五人选择了挑战之路，\n是否顺利要看她们自己……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_04_2014_p", "source_sha256": "30c2231df9a2bd6aab3183992cc00528235ef6005080f78ed58ba041ac6189b8", "ja": "（ただ、その本人達が、まっすぐ進んで\nいけるようにしてやらないとな！）", "zh": "（但我得让她们能够勇往直前才行呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
